{"id":"n58032-2-7","stage":5,"title":"뒤바뀌다 · 完全改变","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58032-2-7-1","ko":"공부 그만하고 영화나 보자.","zh":"别学习了，咱们去看电影吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공부","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}},{"text":"그만하고","meaning":"停止，停","explanation":"그만하다：停止，停；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그만하다","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37072","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만하고","audio":"/audio/a4ec1ecfa14dbb2aad18.mp3"}},{"text":"영화나","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화나","audio":"/audio/986620ce580fc5e124ea.mp3"}},{"text":"보자.","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보자","audio":"/audio/0434c803cb8571c9cf8e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"129344a9c4625793","term":"그만하다","zh":"停止，停","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3","entryId":"37072","definition":"停住正在做的事。","pronunciation":["그만하다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/df8da12e1d2e1a813ddb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58032-2-7-2","ko":"그래. 몇 시간 더 공부한다고 어려운 시험이 쉽게 뒤바뀌겠어?","zh":"好啊。多学几个小时就能让这么难的考试变得简单吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"시간","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"공부한다고","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부하다：学习，读书；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23394","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부한다고","audio":"/audio/1745c16998a9eb840cc5.mp3"}},{"text":"어려운","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려운","audio":"/audio/ed94cdbfc6eeac844633.mp3"}},{"text":"시험이","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험이","audio":"/audio/3539bd8e76462c84a4b0.mp3"}},{"text":"쉽게","meaning":"容易，简单","explanation":"쉽다：容易，简单；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쉽다","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66314","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉽게","audio":"/audio/9d0114858e1606b50f1a.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤바뀌겠어?","meaning":"完全改变，反转","explanation":"뒤바뀌다：完全改变，反转；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뒤바뀌다","audio":"/audio/9b7cb127378a3907324f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58032","senseId":"2","lemma":"뒤바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤바뀌겠어","audio":"/audio/e853d5f4f1bea949f855.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"小时","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62842","definition":"时间单位。表示一天的二十四分之一时长。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"002a60f979d8c3de","term":"공부하다","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3","entryId":"23394","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부하다"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"a39c0e9196a70295","term":"쉽다","zh":"容易，简单","audio":"/audio/a39c0e9196a70295a55f.mp3","entryId":"66314","definition":"做起来不累或不难。","pronunciation":["쉽ː따"]},{"id":"9b7cb127378a3907","term":"뒤바뀌다","zh":"完全改变，反转","audio":"/audio/9b7cb127378a3907324f.mp3","entryId":"58032","definition":"非常大地被改变。","pronunciation":["뒤바뀌다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed36e64da02fa8e01db5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.433,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58032","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":3.9097,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊。多学几个小时就能让这么难的考试变得简单吗？","别学习了，咱们去看电影吧。","注意力会分散的。把音乐关掉再学习吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["别学习了，咱们去看电影吧。","注意力会分散的。把音乐关掉再学习吧。","好啊。多学几个小时就能让这么难的考试变得简单吗？"],"answer":2}]}
